{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_surfer_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_surfer_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"顶峰之景","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"完成任务踏上归途的寻澜，突然离开队友行动，独自走入军工企业的大楼。她的目标简单明确，却造成了意料之外的混乱......","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_surfer_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["黑钢先遣队员","寻澜","安保人员","？？？","管理人员","高级管理人员","“桥夹”克里夫"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_bg_bg_wild_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"哎呀，这趟任务可算是结束了。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"训练的时候虽然针对长距离行动专门练过体能，但和实际出任务真的没法比啊。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"再多跑一小时我的腿可能就要报警咯。你呢，蒂拉，你还好吗？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":15},{"type":"text","text":"佣兵在下午的阳光中伸了个懒腰，然后停下脚步，回头看向离自己只有几步路远的队友。","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"札拉克女孩似乎有些心事，一边走一边频频向四周环视，但在听到同伴声音的那一刻，她马上温柔地笑了起来。","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我感觉挺好的，可能是因为平时我也会自己去野外走很远吧。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"真有你的，就算是例行的侦察任务，强度也不是闹着玩的，你还能额外留出精力来。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"倒也不至于啦，顺利完成任务就好。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"对了，午间口粮里的那块糖果是你放的吧？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"嗯，之前我听你在聊天的时候提到过，你一直都很喜欢吃甜食。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"上午的探察结束之后，休息时适当补充糖分能一定程度缓解疲劳，之后的行动会更轻松。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"所以我就带了一块给你。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"真的多谢你啦。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"没事没事，在外执行任务其实会遇到很多训练里没有接触过的东西，一旦遭遇突发情况又会很危险。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#2$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"帮助别人是我应该做的，不如说我还做得不够多。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"还好今天的活提前干完啦，蒂拉你回去后准备怎么放松，看看电影？还是做些什么别的？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉并没有很快回应，而是若有所思地看向遥远的地平线，像是在看着荒野边缘几栋高层建筑的轮廓。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#9$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"嗯......我不知道......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"text","text":"她说话的声音小了下去，但下一瞬间她像是忽然想起什么一样睁大了双眼。","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#6$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"对了！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"“对了”？还有什么事吗？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"text","text":"她的队友有些摸不着头脑，疑惑地挠着头。","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"不好意思，你一个人先回本舰吧，报告我之后回去做。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我想到一个事情，一定要先去看一看，很快就能做完。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"可是我们的任务不是已经——","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"哦！我懂了！不用多解释，你快去吧。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#3$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"嗯，而且我得赶时间，等一会就没机会了，之后回本舰再见！","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"run1","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":60},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"run1","fadetime":"1.5","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1045_1#1$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"当老板的得力助手也不容易呀，除了日常任务还要接额外的活。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"不过......我没记错的话，那边不是那个军工企业的园区吗？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑钢先遣队员","text":"我们和那边又扯上什么关系了？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"佣兵的视野里只剩下了日落前的空旷景色，他望向远方的办公大楼，不解地眨了眨眼。","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":71},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_bg_bg_uptown_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":75},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":76,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":78},{"type":"animtext","id":79,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>沃尔沃特科钦斯基旗下某工业园区，主办公楼外</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":80},{"type":"animtextclean","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_207","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"停下。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"你没有身穿带有标识的标准制服，是访客的话就出示预约证明，否则禁止进入。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"大楼门口，安保人员拦住了一位自顾自地往里走的札拉克少女。","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"你好，能不能通融一下呢？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我只是来看看，去一趟上面就离开，不会在这里久留。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_207","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"外来人员没有预约证明，不能进入办公楼。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#9$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"嗯......我不能提供什么证明，但我需要上去一趟。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"有必要的话，我的武器和装备都可以留在这里作为担保。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"对我来说这件事很重要，能不能麻烦你让我上去呢？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"安保人员上下打量了一番来客，原本紧绷着的身体似乎稍稍放松了一些。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_207","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"......情报人员？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"对，黑钢先遣小组。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_207","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"要去高层？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"没错。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"听到少女的回答，安保人员明显舒了一口气，接着他向一侧移开一步，让出前进的路。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_207","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"上去吧。记住武器保持收起，远离办公区域，我会知会内部人员和你交接。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"通行时间最长一个小时，严守规定。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"谢谢，我很快就下来。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"run2","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":118},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"run2","fadetime":"1.5","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_207","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"（小声）高层的那群人不知道又在盘算什么怪事情......","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安保人员","text":"（小声）每次都搞得神秘兮兮的，接头线人进来也不让留下记录......","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_207.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"安保人员用余光目送札拉克少女走进正门，自顾自地摇了摇头。","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_bg_bg_motorroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"沃尔沃特科钦斯基办公大楼内，除了数据存储机的低声嗡鸣，还有快速响起的脚步声在无人的楼层间回荡着。","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"run3","id":136},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"run3","fadetime":"1.5","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"札拉克少女在这些楼层一刻都没有停留，只是一味地走向通往更高层的楼梯。","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"电梯在到达十五层之前就停止运行了，她不得不穿过一整层工作区，挤开面带讶异的人群，跑进楼梯间继续向上走。","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"只要能赶在结束之前走上去的话——","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"小姐！请你......停一下！","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1259_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"一个西装革履的身影气喘吁吁地挡在她面前，他弯腰撑着扶手，连喘几口气后才直起身。","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"......听我说两句好吗？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"不管你来这里的目的是什么，都不能再往上走了。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"上面是严禁外部人员出入的区域，你已经破坏了访客规定了，我得请你离开。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#11$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"可我还要到上面去看一看，只到这里是看不到想看的东西的。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"放宽心，对你们公司的事务我一点都不关心，你们做了什么事情我也不在乎。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我上去之后马上就会离开。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"说着她就准备继续向上走，眼前身着西装的人赶忙伸出一只手臂拦住她的去路。","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1259_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"小姐，我知道你是带着任务来的，但我不能放任你继续调查我们公司了。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#11$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"调查？你在说什么？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我要去的是楼顶，那里什么都没有。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1259_1#1$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"你还想去上层的核心区？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"不可能的小姐，你在离开访客区域的那一刻就触发警报了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"当时我们只能紧急停止客梯运行，没想到你还一路往核心区走。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"先生，重申一次，我没有任何东西要调查。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"急着上楼的少女再一次迈出脚步，但这一次对方不是伸出一只手了，而是用整个身子堵住楼梯。","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1259_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"再走一步，我就通知整栋大楼的警备，你就别想从这里全身而退了。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"大家都不想把事情闹得太难看，在事态升级之前请你快点离开这里——","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"run4","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":179},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"run4","fadetime":"1.5","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"text","text":"站在台阶上方的男人还没有来得及说完话，札拉克少女就已经敏捷地翻过了楼梯扶手。","id":183},{"type":"text","text":"一眨眼之间，她就已经大跨步向高层走去，楼梯间里留下一句带着回声的回应。","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"不好意思，再拖下去就真的看不到了，有什么话留到之后再说！","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1259_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"......看不到？什么看不到？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"text","text":"管理人员呆呆地看着少女消失的方向，数秒后他才反应过来，而后举起了手中的通讯器。","id":188},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":189,"musicid":2},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1259_1#1$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"管理人员","text":"老板，紧急情况，麻烦您来处理一下！","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_1259_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":197},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"run5","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":201},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"run5","fadetime":"1.5","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉几乎是一步三级地朝更高楼层走去。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"与有人工作的楼层不同，楼梯间外传来的声音越来越小，她感觉到了，自己离楼顶的距离也越来越近。","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"又上了一层楼后，她看到了楼梯的终点，和那扇通向楼顶的门。但同时她也看到，另一个人已在门口等待着。","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"小姐，我是这里的负责人之一。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"您的调查行动在公司内部造成了不小的混乱，也造成了很多误会。您和我做一次最终谈判，解决这个问题怎么样？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉放慢脚步走到高管面前，她能看到那只撑着手杖的手在不断颤抖。","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"您好，先生。误会就是，我不是来调查的，也没有任何任务。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"事到如今，何必遮遮掩掩呢？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"我知道你是克里夫的亲信，我这里虽然只是沃尔沃特科钦斯基的一家分公司，不过，一点点话语权也还是有的。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"相信不管是我们还是黑钢，都希望事态平息吧。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"text","text":"说着，沃尔沃特科钦斯基的代表人伸出右手做出一个手势。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"告诉我克里夫对你吩咐了什么，我们可以为你提供——","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我的行动与克里夫先生无关。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"......哈，是我想简单了。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#2$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"先生，事情就是很单纯。我就只是去你们的楼顶一趟，我不会做任何有损你们利益的事情，之后我会立刻离开。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"不然，您可以自己想一想，我能在楼顶看到什么机密信息？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"带着不可告人的目的跑到这儿来的是你！我要是能猜到克里夫要什么，直接跟他打电话不就结了！","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"你当我是第一天面对你们这种情报人员吗？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"......不如您现在就给他打个电话如何？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"别耍花招了——","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我没时间和您解释了，先生。再拖下去，我想看的美景就彻底看不到了。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"您要是执意不相信，不如和我一起走上楼顶看看。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"我会让您亲自见证，我们之间的误会到底有多大。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"“美景”？哼，看来这是什么黑钢内部的暗语了？这次行动的名字叫什么？“美景行动”？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#2$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"......看来是彻彻底底说不通啊。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"虽然让您这样一个满脑子商战的人跟在身边多少有点煞风景，但您看这样如何？","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"您把路让开，让我上去，在此期间，您可以一直监视我，如果我有什么出格的举动，可以立刻将我驱逐出去。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"那我要你现在就——","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#8$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"......这场交易可还没成立呢，先生。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"text","text":"高管紧盯着蒂拉的眼睛，试图权衡放眼前这个人上天台和得罪克里夫究竟哪个更加糟糕。","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"最终，他稍稍让出了半个身位。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"我答应你的条件，但我会盯紧你，别想从这里带走任何一点东西！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"放心好了，先生。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"那就看好了。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉走向通往楼顶的门，伸手将它推开。","id":268},{"type":"dialog","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":272},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"47_g15_eveningglow_L1/47_g15_eveningglow_R1/47_g15_eveningglow_L2/47_g15_eveningglow_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-640","fadetime":"0","id":273},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"60","yFrom":"360","yTo":"720","block":"false","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":275},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":276,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"黄昏时分，空旷的楼顶上流动的清风吹过蒂拉的面颊。","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"今天的夕阳与平时看起来不同，在有些朦胧的天空中，光芒从云层的各个缝隙间散射而出。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"而那些橙红色的光芒，形成无数道各有间隔的光柱，点亮云底和半边暗色的天空。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉站在门口看向天地交界线上的光芒，然后如释重负般地叹了口气。","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"真好......","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"这是......什么？","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"夕阳，但不是普通的夕阳，也许很多年都只能看到一次这样的景象。","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"只有在沙尘天气结束后放晴的下午，加上完美的能见度，再配合天边合适的云形......","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"所有条件都得到满足，才能让阳光在空中散射成如此美妙的样子。","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"虽然上来的路并不顺利，但能看到这样稀少的景色，一切都是值得的。","id":288},{"type":"charslot","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"高管望着天边闪耀夺目的阳光束，他难以掩饰脸上的复杂表情。","id":290},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"gridbg","id":294},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_bg_64_g13_rooftop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"就这些？你不去找找别的东西？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"就看看天就完事了？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"为什么要做别的事情呢？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"她慢步走向金属防护网，高管在她身后怔怔立着，一步都跨不出去。","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"比起这栋大楼里的人和事，现在这片美景对我来说才是有意义的。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"观赏它的地点和时间都必须刚刚好，而我找到了对的地点。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#3$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"您看，在你们急着找不存在的问题和答案的时候，景色又变了。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉伸出手，指向西方的地平线，高管也不由自主地顺着她的指引看向天边。","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"太阳已经落下，但余晖依然在云间留下美妙而夺目的光芒，像是明亮的火焰从地平线下升腾而起。","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"时间正好，位置也和我想象中的一样，这里真的是附近最好的观景地。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"看到这栋楼的那一眼我就感觉到了，只有从楼顶的角度才能看到，这难得一见的景色。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#2$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"无论你们误解我想做什么，我唯一的想法，自始至终就只有看到这片美景而已。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"好了，我在这里要做的事情都做完了，您现在明白我的目的了吗？","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"这......可是......","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉看了看依然无法接受现状的高管，耸了耸肩。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"如果您同意的话，我现在可以离开这里了吗？","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高级管理人员","text":"......","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#10$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"谢谢您的理解。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"0.6","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"本舰，先遣小组蒂拉呼叫，请求人员支援以便返回。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"高管在逐渐暗下的天色中看着蒂拉完成通话，然后任凭她从自己的身边走向门口。","id":337},{"type":"text","text":"很快，刚才动人心弦的景色就消失不见，楼顶上只剩下孑然站立的一个人。","id":338},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"charslot","id":342},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_bg_42_g9_modernoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":344},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":345,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1036_1#1$1","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“桥夹”克里夫","text":"蒂拉，说明情况。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1036_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"黑钢的老板拉开椅子坐了下来，他看向站在桌边的蒂拉，少女的表情很是平静。","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"在回本舰的路上，我看到那栋楼的时候，就突然想到那里的楼顶应该有绝佳的观景角度。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"今天恰好任务完成得比较顺利，在日落之前就结束了，加上天气也很完美——","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#5$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"所以就想上去看看，毕竟见到那种稀少景色的机会实在太难得了。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1036_1#2$1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“桥夹”克里夫","text":"我不是在问你这个。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1036_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1036_1#6$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“桥夹”克里夫","text":"今天下午你造成的混乱你自己也知道。沃尔沃特科钦斯基从分公司到总公司不断给我打电话。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1036_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#5$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"非常抱歉！","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#7$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"可是......","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"那种夕照散射的样子只要条件稍有变化就会消失，只有在特定的时间登上楼顶才有机会看到。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#2$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"那样的夕景，即便想要寻找也很难遇到第二次了......","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"克里夫皱起眉头看着自己的助手，但很快他脸上凝重的表情就缓和了下来。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#5$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"老板，要是没别的事的话，我就......","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1036_1#2$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“桥夹”克里夫","text":"......","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1036_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#9$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"克里夫先生，那个——","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1036_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“桥夹”克里夫","text":"既然你已经放松过了，正巧现在有个很棘手的任务，需要一个得力的人手。任务概要在这儿，你可以自己看。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1036_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#6$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"单人潜入任务，基本上全程在地下通道里完成。没有夕阳，没有森林，甚至没有天然洞穴......","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#5$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"老板，这算是对我的报复吗？","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1036_1#1$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“桥夹”克里夫","text":"其他能完成任务的人碰巧都不在，仅此而已。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1036_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"哈哈......","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"见札拉克没有推脱的意思，克里夫冲她点了点头，径自离开了办公室。","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#2$1","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"难得一见的夕阳景色，换一次既无聊又危险的潜入任务......勉勉强强说得过去吧。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#3$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"而且克里夫先生这次居然没扣我的假期，难道他今天心情其实不错？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#1$1","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"......算了，与其去猜克里夫先生高兴还是不高兴，还不如老老实实照他说的做呢。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1040_1#3$1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"寻澜","text":"走啦。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_1040_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"bgeffect","id":403},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":404},{"type":"image","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406}],"characters":["黑钢先遣队员","寻澜","安保人员","？？？","管理人员","高级管理人员","“桥夹”克里夫"]}